    "zh": "《明日方舟》干员铃兰（本名丽萨），Q 版二头身、侧身朝右站：金色长发与蓝色发带，一对大狐耳，身后九条蓬松的尾巴。四套衣服：默认的白蓝连衣裙、春之颂的连帽春装（头顶趴着一只黑猫）、雪霁的振袖和伞、弃土花开的探索者装束与太阳能法杖。",
    "en": "Suzuran (Lisa) from Arknights, chibi facing right: blonde hair, blue headband, big fox ears, nine tails. Four outfits: the default white-and-blue dress, the Spring Praise hooded outfit with a small black cat on her head, the After Snow kimono with a paper umbrella, and the Bloom on Barren Soil explorer gear with a solar-panel staff."
